v 3
d quadriceps. Positive-weight cubature rules for the Gaussian weight and the cube
d
d {bf:ghpos} and {bf:lepos} return the smallest positive-weight cubature rules known to
d the author for the standard normal density on R^d and the uniform density on
d [0,1]^d, dimensions 2 to 5, with a fallback to the cheapest tensor product of
d lower-dimensional rules elsewhere. The rules are described in Pinkse (2026),
d Positive weight Hermite and Legendre quadrature rules, arXiv:2609.26840,
d doi:10.5281/zenodo.22904159. Stata twin of the Julia package Quadriceps.jl.
d
d Requires Stata 16 or later.
d
d Author: Joris Pinkse, Penn State
d Support: https://github.com/NittanyLion/quadriceps-stata/issues
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260924
d
f quadriceps.ado
f ghpos.ado
f lepos.ado
F quadriceps.mata
f quadriceps.sthlp
f ghpos.sthlp
f lepos.sthlp
F quadriceps_rules.bin
F quadriceps_index.tsv
f quadriceps_test.do
